Error [E0068]: This callable uses the retired result-arrow shape.
  --> tests/ui/carrier_partial_not_kept.jet:7:32
    |
  7 | fn import_rows(rows: [String]) => [String] ! ImportErr {
    |                                ^^
 Why: a return type sits after the parameter list, and `->` introduces the body; an effect ceiling follows the return type
 Fix: write `fn name(...) Type -> body`, or `fn name(...) Type -[Effects]> { … }`

Error [E0302]: `ImportErr` has no field `partial`
  --> tests/ui/carrier_partial_not_kept.jet:14:19
    |
 14 |     print((spotty.partial() ?? []).len())
    |                   ^^^^^^^
 Why: an error type keeps part of its work by carrying it as a field named `partial`
 Fix: add a `partial` field to `ImportErr`
